{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126230212185-1126_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261126230212\"/><p>部分被捕女子。</p><p>執法部門聯同相關部門，根據線報及深入調查後，今日(26日)下午在灣仔區展開代號「虎尾」的掃黃行動，突擊搜查皇后大道東及駱克道多個樓上單位，以涉嫌「違反逗留條件」拘捕10名內地女子(16歲至45歲)。所有被捕人士現正被扣留調查，稍後將交由相關部門跟進。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T15:43:59.834814+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T15:02:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T15:37:19.273609+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T15:37:19.273609+00:00","content_hash":"e17bcdfb5cb0d509e4f2b4a46ae8f4f894982f0866cec8c667e58abec203d043","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}